Package: rotawriter
Title: Contract-Compliant On-Call Rotas for Resident Doctors
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Mark", "Jeffrey", email = "mark@markjeffrey.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads rota inputs from a spreadsheet, checks rotas against the
    2016 TCS for resident doctors in England, and (later) writes rotas by
    mixed-integer optimisation.
